    "Every pre-existing driven-loop test's fake-deps object must gain a working resolveMechanicalModel or buildAutopilot will now throw 'd.resolveMechanicalModel is not a function' on line 1 of runAutopilot — fix centrally in makeFakes, not per test-call-site.",
