ripts/verify-workflow-autopilot.sh` extended to cover the new sizing (including an AC-MODEL-style sweep with a bootstrap whitelist and planted-mutation self-test) and the tightened empty-result handling, while updating the harness's shared `makeFakes` so every pre-existing driven-loop test keeps passing with a default resolved mechanical model."
